8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a09db7c2dab60d0a\" href=\"?note=a09db7c2dab60d0a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-theory\">17-df-strongly-minimal-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7584f09844a93bb\" href=\"?note=a7584f09844a93bb\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-dimension\">17-df-strongly-minimal-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-7.2.4"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L\\)</span> (strongly minimal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a09db7c2dab60d0a\" href=\"?note=a09db7c2dab60d0a\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-theory\">17-df-strongly-minimal-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> (strongly minimal dimension, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a7584f09844a93bb\" href=\"?note=a7584f09844a93bb\" title=\"17-df-strongly-minimal-dimension\">17-df-strongly-minimal-dimension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n=\n\\dim_{\\mathfrak B}(|\\mathfrak B|)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{StronglyMinimalTheory}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(|\\mathfrak A|)\n=\n\\dim_{\\mathfrak B}(|\\mathfrak B|)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Models of a complete strongly minimal theory are determined up to isomorphism by the dimension of their strongly minimal universes. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stability alone does not classify all same-cardinality models.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"